Given the assumption that you actually wanted unholy water,
this is where you stop.  Don't "uncurse" it.

cursed water = unholy water

If you remove the curse, you no longer have unholy water.
Similarly blessed water is holy water.  You will never ever
see a 'blessed potion of unholy water'

